  "description": "The performance advantage is clear. Tunnel tested and proven in race conditions with our pros, the V-PRi is our fastest machine yet, performing on everything from the hills and roundabouts of Nice to the flat, fast, windy conditions found in Kona. All achieved with aerodynamic refinements, improved integrated fit, and innovative race-day hydration and storage solutions.\nExclusive IRONMAN paint scheme and M-Dot logo on top tube\nPersonalized with the owner’s name and country (or any other desired motto or statement) alongside the M-Dot on the top tube\nFully refined frame and updated fork comprised of cutting-edge carbon cloth resulting in industry-leading weight savings and improved aero advantage any conditions\nFrame-integrated FuelBay™ Bottle, easily refilled on the fly (22oz capacity size S, 25.5 oz size M & L)\nFrame-integrated FuelBay™ Nutrition storage, capable of storing up to six gels\nIntelligent Integration Cockpit (IIC) designed for aerodynamic optimization with frame with full fit adjustability *Available as an upgrade option on the Ultegra V-PRi, the IIC comes standard with Dura-Ace and SRAM RED. Note: the IIC is NOT compatible with aftermarket extension extenders.\nUniversal Derailleur Hanger (UDH) standard for improved shift reliability\nSHIFT downtube for improved airflow\nLeading Edge Absent (LEA) non-driveside chainstay for improved airflow and weight savings\nIncluded powermeter with every build\nInvisible cable routing\nConfident fit window\nLightweight QR.SP carbon seatpost\nIntegrated universal computer mount available\nFit-Ready option available\nQR Lifetime Warranty\nOrder online direct with with full-assembly shipping options or visit a QR retailer",
